meta {
  name: Delete User
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/user
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "confirm_email": "jane@example.com",
    "current_password": "Password1!"
  }
}

docs {
  Deletes the authenticated user's account and revokes all of their
  tokens. Destructive — use a disposable test account.

  `confirm_email` must match the account email. `current_password` is
  required unless the account signs in with Google or GitHub (see
  `Get Deletion Blockers` → `requires_password`).

  Workspaces the user owns alone are deleted with the account. Responds
  `409` with `errors.workspaces` (each `{ id, name, reasons }`, reasons
  `has_other_members` / `active_subscription`) while the user owns a
  workspace other people belong to or one with a renewing subscription.

  Responds `204 No Content` with no envelope on success.
}
